havior.   In case of emergency, nearby devices will be alerted immediately and a signal will be sent to our central server, which will send the location of the accident to the nearest emergency centers. This will also act as a base for smart traffic management system.","topics":[],"score":172726,"global_rank":411449},{"name":"alankjackson/VoterChallenge","owner":"alankjackson","html_url":"https://github.com/alankjackson/VoterChallenge","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Build list of po box voter reg addresses in republican areas","topics":[],"score":172726,"global_rank":411450},{"name":"mbmcc/PPP","owner":"mbmcc","html_url":"https://github.com/mbmcc/PPP","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":172726,"global_rank":411451},{"name":"vritant24/ProsePro","owner":"vritant24","html_url":"https://github.com/vritant24/ProsePro","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A Word Processor for Professional and Hobbyist writer, with inbuilt version control functionality","topics":[],"score":172726,"global_rank":411452},{"name":"greenamy808/Seattle_Aquarium_Hawaii_coral_reef_fish_monitoring","owner":"greenamy808","html_url":"https://github.com/greenamy808/Seattle_Aquarium_Hawaii_coral_reef_fish_monitoring","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"This repository contains all code and data associated with \"A novel underwater survey method documents changes in abundance, richness, and community structure of Hawai\u02b9i reef fishes\"","topics":[],"score":172723,"global_rank":411453},{"name":"sannidhi/packo","owner":"sannidhi","html_url":"https://github.com/sannidhi/packo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Run all of kpack's image builds in parallel","topics":[],"score":172718,"global_rank":411454},{"name":"agarner101/ReactSocks","owner":"agarner101","html_url":"